[issue by Sebz102030]
### Minecraft Version

1.20.6

### What happened?

On server MohistMC curios API throws error when modern fix is present

Mod list:
![Screenshot_20241110_194256_Termux](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad0e7840-a59d-48f5-84c5-2290ccc31b4e)


### How do you trigger this bug?

Install MohistMC on java 17
Install all mods from modlist above
Run server
Join server
Go in creative and open inventory

### Loader

Forge

### Loader Version

47.3.11

### Mod Version

5.11.0

